bool g_quitDraining = false;
// P6c (p5z MEDIUM-5) - IS THE POST-TEARDOWN FLUSH ACTUALLY WRITING ANYTHING? E33 re-ordered TeardownBroadcastLateFlags to
// run AFTER the flush precisely so a zone queued by the engine's own streaming worker could still be written, and
// that is the only claim the re-ordering makes. `zoneWritten` and `zoneSkippedNotMine` are shared with the whole run
