    /* P6x: if the PREVIOUS teardown's late log never ran, its flags ran without it - that is the unwind, and this
       is the first moment it is provable, so it is counted here rather than swept for by a tick. A single unwind
       with no teardown after it stays visible as teardownLateLogPending=1 in the report. */
